---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | ExamHub.pk"
  description="Read our comprehensive privacy policy to understand how ExamHub.pk collects, protects, and handles your data, cookies, and advertising identifiers."
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-teal-950 text-white py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300">Effective Date: October 23, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose prose-lg prose-slate">
    <h2>1. Introduction & Overview</h2>
    <p>
      ExamHub.pk ("we," "us," "our," or "the Site") is committed to safeguarding your privacy and ensuring transparent information practices. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, store, share, and protect your information when you access or interact with our website (<a href="https://examhub.pk">https://examhub.pk</a>) and our related mobile applications and online services.
    </p>
    <p>
      By using ExamHub.pk, you consent to the data collection and usage practices described in this policy. If you do not agree with the terms outlined herein, please discontinue using the Site.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information in two principal ways: automatically through technology and voluntarily provided by you.</p>

    <h3>A. Automatically Collected Information</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Log & Device Data:</strong> When you browse ExamHub.pk, our web servers and analytics tools automatically record log data, including your Internet Protocol (IP) address, browser brand and version, operating system, device type, referring/exit URLs, requested pages, date/time stamps, and clickstream interactions.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookies and Web Beacons:</strong> We, along with third-party vendors including Google, employ cookies (small alphanumeric text files saved to your device), web beacons (pixel tags), and similar local storage technologies to collect information about your visits, preferences, and engagement on our website.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics Identifiers:</strong> We utilize Google Analytics 4 (GA4) and Google Tag Manager (GTM) to aggregate statistical data on user traffic patterns, session duration, and page interactions.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>B. Voluntarily Provided Information</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact Inquiries:</strong> When you reach out to us via our contact forms or customer support email (<a href="mailto:support@examhub.pk">support@examhub.pk</a>), we collect your name, email address, subject matter, and the message content you provide.</li>
      <li><strong>Account & Quiz Feedback:</strong> If you register an account, bookmark questions, or report MCQ corrections, we collect your submitted feedback and session state.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the collected information for legitimate educational, operational, and commercial purposes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>To deliver, maintain, and optimize our competitive exam preparation content, practice sets, and syllabus mock tests.</li>
      <li>To detect, prevent, and mitigate security threats, abuse, fraud, and unauthorized scraping.</li>
      <li>To respond promptly to user support inquiries, technical issues, and content feedback.</li>
      <li>To analyze platform performance, audience trends, and popular syllabus topics to expand high-yield study materials.</li>
      <li>To serve relevant educational advertisements that help fund the free availability of our exam prep library.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Google Advertising, AdSense & DoubleClick Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense and Google advertising platform products to serve ads when you visit our website. Maintaining trust in the digital advertising ecosystem requires rigorous adherence to Google Publisher Policies and privacy standards.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Third-Party Vendor Ad Serving:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to ExamHub.pk or other websites on the internet.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Advertising Cookies:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies (such as DoubleClick or Google advertising identifiers) enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visits to ExamHub.pk and/or other sites across the internet.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Web Beacons & IP Addresses:</strong> Third parties may be placing and reading cookies on your browser, or using web beacons or IP addresses to collect information as a result of ad serving on our website.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>How Google Uses Information:</strong> For comprehensive details on how Google collects and processes data when you access websites partnering with Google, please consult Google's official disclosure:
        <br />
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-700">
          How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services →
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Opting Out of Personalized Advertising:</strong> You have the right to opt out of interest-based and personalized advertising:
        <ul>
          <li>You can customize or opt out of Google personalized ads by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
          <li>You may also opt out of third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting the Digital Advertising Alliance at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a> or the Network Advertising Initiative at <a href="https://www.networkadvertising.org/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.networkadvertising.org/choices/</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Google Analytics & Tracking Technologies</h2>
    <p>
      ExamHub.pk uses Google Analytics to measure visitor traffic and usage patterns. Google Analytics collects information sent by your browser, such as pages visited, geographical region, device specifications, and referral sources.
    </p>
    <p>
      The IP address transmitted by your browser within the scope of Google Analytics is not merged with other Google data. You can prevent Google Analytics from recording your data by downloading and installing the official browser add-on:
      <br />
      <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-Out Browser Add-on →</a>
    </p>

    <h2>6. Cookie Management & Browser Controls</h2>
    <p>
      You have the ability to accept or decline cookies. Most web browsers automatically accept cookies, but you can usually modify your browser settings to decline cookies or alert you when a cookie is being placed:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Chrome: Settings → Privacy and Security → Cookies and other site data</li>
      <li>Firefox: Options → Privacy & Security → Enhanced Tracking Protection</li>
      <li>Safari: Preferences → Privacy → Block all cookies</li>
      <li>Edge: Settings → Cookies and site permissions</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Please note that if you disable cookies completely, certain interactive features of ExamHub.pk (such as quiz bookmarking, custom test preferences, and dark/light themes) may not function as intended.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Children's Online Privacy Protection (COPPA)</h2>
    <p>
      ExamHub.pk is designed for adult students and candidates preparing for university entrance and professional competitive civil service examinations (such as CSS, PMS, FPSC, PPSC, and NTS). We do not knowingly collect, request, or target personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe that a child under 13 has provided personal data to us, please notify us immediately at <a href="mailto:support@examhub.pk">support@examhub.pk</a> so we can remove the data.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Data Security and Safeguards</h2>
    <p>
      We implement industry-standard technical, physical, and administrative security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. All data transmission across ExamHub.pk is encrypted in transit using Transport Layer Security (TLS/HTTPS).
    </p>

    <h2>9. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have statutory rights regarding your personal data, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The right to know what personal information we hold about you.</li>
      <li>The right to request the correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
      <li>The right to request the deletion or erasure of your personal data.</li>
      <li>The right to object to or restrict processing of your information.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise any of these rights, please email us directly at <a href="mailto:support@examhub.pk">support@examhub.pk</a>. We respond to all verified requests within 30 business days.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to modify or update this Privacy Policy at any time to reflect updates in legal requirements, publisher standards, or site features. When changes are made, we will update the "Effective Date" at the top of this document. We encourage you to periodically review this page to stay informed about how we protect your information.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Contact Information</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions, feedback, or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or our advertising and cookie disclosures, please contact us at:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://examhub.pk">ExamHub.pk</a></li>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@examhub.pk">support@examhub.pk</a></li>
      <li><strong>Contact Page:</strong> <a href="/contact">https://examhub.pk/contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
